sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Wallet as Wallet (pq-signer)
    participant Pool as Mempool<br/>(Conflict Detector)
    participant Chain as Block Execution<br/>(pallet-qutxo)
    participant WASM as Crypto Verifier<br/>(ML-DSA-44)

    Note over User,WASM: Genesis mint
    User->>Chain: sudo_mint(1B, recipient_lock)
    Chain->>Chain: UtxoSet.insert(hash, Utxo{value, lock})
    Chain-->>User: UTXO #1 created

    Note over User,WASM: Spend attempt
    User->>Wallet: "send 400M to X, 600M change"
    Wallet->>Wallet: build SCALE payload
    Wallet->>WASM: sign(payload, private_key)
    WASM-->>Wallet: 2420-byte ML-DSA-44 sig
    Wallet->>Pool: submit(unsigned_extrinsic)

    Pool->>Pool: check per-input conflict tags
    alt conflict with pending tx
        Pool-->>Wallet: ❌ "Priority too low"
    else no conflict
        Pool->>Pool: check UtxoSet.contains_key()
        alt UTXO already spent
            Pool-->>Wallet: ❌ "Transaction is outdated"
        else UTXO live
            Pool->>Chain: accepted, awaiting block
            Chain->>WASM: verify_aegis_transaction()
            WASM->>WASM: blake2_256(witness_pubkey) == lock?
            alt lock mismatch
                WASM-->>Chain: ❌ LockMismatch
            else lock matches
                WASM->>WASM: MlDsaKeyPair::verify(sig, payload, pk)
                alt sig invalid
                    WASM-->>Chain: ❌ SignatureVerificationFailed
                else sig valid
                    WASM-->>Chain: ✅ Ok
                    Chain->>Chain: destroy input UTXO
                    Chain->>Chain: create 2 child UTXOs
                    Chain-->>User: ✅ 400M + 600M UTXOs
                end
            end
        end
    end
